# Leaks accepted for now. One entry per leak, with a reason.

# Fontconfig builds its configuration on the first use and keeps it until the
# process ends (Xft never calls FcFini). It is not ours to free.
leak:libfontconfig.so

# The test client of tests/fake_client.h whose connection was killed on purpose
# (close_kills_a_client_without_delete_protocol) cannot be closed cleanly.
leak:FakeClient::FakeClient

# StyleDefaultsTest.a_font_of_a_display_that_is_gone_is_not_closed closes the
# display under a font on purpose: the font of a display that is gone can not
# be freed (the process frees it when it ends).
leak:StyleDefaultsTest_a_font_of_a_display_that_is_gone_is_not_closed_Test
